    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up alone in a stylized, infected world\u2014abandoned buildings, warped landscapes, and the stench of death in the air. With nothing but your instincts, you\u2019ll need to survive the night... and the next one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dead don\u2019t rest here.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1754601105\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up alone in a stylized, infected world\u2014abandoned buildings, warped landscapes, and the stench of death in the air. With nothing but your instincts, you\u2019ll need to survive the night... and the next one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dead don\u2019t rest here.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1754601105\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Alone, unarmed, and surrounded by the dead\u2014you\u2019ve just woken up in a world that\u2019s collapsed. Stylized, surreal, and crawling with infected and hostile wildlife, every moment is a fight to stay alive. Explore crumbling ruins, scavenge what you can, and craft the tools you need to survive.",
